    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5ffcd1e4f9ac303d3dfbeb0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我看到好几幅比豪华绚烂的水晶灯\n还耀眼的赛马娘肖像画……每位画中人物\n都有着和第一红宝石类似，难以亲近的眼神。",
      "source_fingerprint": "60a317007bb5b9c6a168ee7299861ce4d1671bd0d719ae1f0c2aee3aecf7083e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085100.json",
