    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b309483795fa2ed0c0bca299",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“但活跃于后冠路线的赛马娘\n大多倾向早熟，\n因此我当初才希望第一红宝石尽早参赛──”",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ce32c20db6aaba9cd50e78968ad2d84628abfbc4312d0b761b80495e552bf23",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
