      "uid": "zhcn:840927730b8f36fe30a66ef2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“期望第一红宝石替母亲雪耻，\n务必要达成三后冠的成就”──\n那篇专栏的大意是这样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7800b1e5355dec1b50f6737c0f956a049ab42d98984bc8f3ef062c9a6c6b686e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
